libmodi
------------------------------------------
libmodi is a library to access the Mac OS disk image formats.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcdirectory1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile1-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libfmos1-20260520-1bl1
  libfplist1-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue1-20260531-1bl1
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libmodi-devel-20260902-1bl1
  libmodi1-20260902-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

