Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libmodi

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libmodi/archive/refs/tags/20260902.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libmodi-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libmodi-20260902-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libmodi-20260902-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmodi-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmodi1-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmodi-devel-20260902-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libmodi-20260902-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libmodi)
  /usr/bin/modiinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/modimount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libmodi.README
  /usr/share/doc/libmodi/AUTHORS
